# Tiki Lagoon's lagoon cave (CIPlay tiki_lagoon_cave, 11-12 w14 prep; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in the recipe:
# kit_uw mouth on the sea floor at 10 -60 (pad -5; yaw 0: way in = +z), tunnel 29.1 m up 15 degrees (+7.5 m), the den
# beyond (middle ~10 -20) under a new dune; air zone tl_seacave there, the chest tlseacavechest.
# Heights are guesses: the pad -5, the den floor ~+2.5.
# 11-17 w14E run: swim stuck at the water line (fixed below). Was offline-written; the offset is the old one - re-read it after the build (a new hill may move the land centre).
island Tiki Lagoon keep
offset 1.3959 -6.753
hour 11
weather Calm

empty
picture tl_seacave_out 10 6 -85 10 3 -20
# From the sea outside the mouth, down to it and up the tunnel (15 degrees, 4 pieces) into the dry den
at 10 -68 h=-2
# (11-17 w14E: the tool clamps the slope to 12 degrees, so the tunnel leaves the water near 10 -37 (floor ~0) - a swimmer
# stuck at the surface at 10 -41; swim in under water, walk the dry rest - as hailstone_weir/vaporhold do)
# (w14G: the floor at 10 -41 is at +0.2 - -0.6 there was under it; the swim ends 3 m lower down the slope, 0.2 m over its floor)
swim 10 -68 -3.5 to 10 -60 -3.5 to 10 -51 -1.5 to 10 -44 -0.3
walk 10 -41 to 10 -38 to 10 -34 to 10 -31 to 10 -25 to 10 -20 below=5
air tl_seacave here
picture tl_seacave_in 10 4 -30 10 3 -20 light=20
open Staff stash
wait 2
expect item Battery 1
# (w14I: the swim out is put on its first point - at -0.8 that was under the floor (stuck); it now runs the swim in's own line back)
walk 10 -20 to 10 -25 to 10 -31 to 10 -34 to 10 -38 to 10 -41 below=5
swim 10 -44 -0.3 to 10 -47.5 -0.9 to 10 -51 -1.5 to 10 -60 -3.5 to 10 -68 -2
